flowchart TD
    A[Customer chat message] --> B[POST /chat/turn API]
    B --> C[handle_chat_turn]
    C --> D[Intent recognition: LLM + embedding + keyword voting]
    D --> E[ConversationOrchestrator: load tenant config, constraints, memory]

    E --> F[ConversationLoop: GeneralAgent ReAct, MAX_REACT_LOOPS = 6]
    F --> G{Step: LLM complete + parse tool_calls}
    G -->|tool calls| H[dispatch_tool_call through resilient tool layer]
    H --> I[query_health / query_playbooks RAG]
    H --> J[delegate_billing / delegate_technical / delegate_escalation]
    J --> K[ReAct specialist subagent]
    I --> G
    K --> G
    G -->|no tool calls| L[Natural exit]
    F -->|step == MAX_REACT_LOOPS| M[Forced Synthesis: strip tools + directive]

    L --> N[LLMClient.stream: real token streaming]
    M --> N
    N --> O[SSE events: status / token / done / error]
    O --> P[Final customer reply]

    P --> Q[Store chat messages]
    Q --> R[Background profile update: fire-and-forget]
    P --> S{Complaint, escalation, or high urgency?}
    S -->|Yes| T[Start Temporal ProcessSignalWorkflow]
    S -->|No| U[Complete]
    T --> U

    F -. telemetry .-> V[Structured logs + Langfuse / OpenTelemetry]

    classDef async fill:#FFF3CD,stroke:#856404,color:#111;
    classDef safety fill:#F8D7DA,stroke:#842029,color:#111;
    classDef storage fill:#D1E7DD,stroke:#0F5132,color:#111;
    class R,T async;
    class O safety;
    class Q storage;
